1
00:00:01,166 --> 00:00:01,916
Brother.

2
00:00:02,041 --> 00:00:03,041
Brother?

3
00:00:05,166 --> 00:00:06,333
Can you hear me?

4
00:00:07,291 --> 00:00:07,958
Brother?

5
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,208
Brother!

6
00:00:09,209 --> 00:00:10,415
Can you hear me, Brother?

7
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:11,665
Brother, it's me, Lin Zai!

8
00:00:11,666 --> 00:00:12,666
Brother!

9
00:00:27,916 --> 00:00:29,083
What did you do to him?

10
00:00:31,166 --> 00:00:31,666
This is impossible.

11
00:00:31,667 --> 00:00:33,083
What the hell did you do?!

12
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,500
I don't know!

13
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,500
Get out.

14
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:43,250
Everyone, get out!

15
00:00:43,333 --> 00:00:44,333
Out!

16
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,791
Lin Zai, are you alright?

17
00:01:00,458 --> 00:01:03,083
Get out. Leave me alone.

18
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,416
I'll be right outside.

19
00:01:36,875 --> 00:01:38,083
It's all my fault.

20
00:01:39,666 --> 00:01:41,208
I ruined you again.

21
00:02:22,583 --> 00:02:23,833
Everything is ruined.

22
00:02:24,125 --> 00:02:25,875
Lin Zai is a dead end now.

23
00:02:27,208 --> 00:02:27,833
No.

24
00:02:28,125 --> 00:02:29,125
I can't give up.

25
00:02:31,083 --> 00:02:32,243
There is still one other way.

26
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:37,500
"The Last Oath"

27
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:42,500
(Episode 22: My Little Brother)

28
00:04:08,166 --> 00:04:09,583
It's me, He Yao.

29
00:04:10,375 --> 00:04:11,875
Regarding what you asked me before,

30
00:04:12,250 --> 00:04:13,583
I've made my decision.

31
00:04:15,083 --> 00:04:16,250
My proof of good faith

32
00:04:16,708 --> 00:04:18,548
is the immune subject
you've been looking for.

33
00:04:20,666 --> 00:04:21,666
My terms are simple.

34
00:04:21,916 --> 00:04:23,916
I can tell you where he is,

35
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,290
but once you take him,

36
00:04:25,291 --> 00:04:27,750
all follow-up research will
be under my full control.

37
00:04:29,916 --> 00:04:30,916
Deal.

38
00:04:31,541 --> 00:04:33,582
Two hundred kilometers
northeast of Ludao Airport,

39
00:04:33,583 --> 00:04:35,083
there is an abandoned film studio.

40
00:04:35,541 --> 00:04:36,875
How soon can your team arrive?

41
00:04:40,083 --> 00:04:41,083
Good.

42
00:04:41,416 --> 00:04:43,083
I'll await your arrival then.

43
00:04:58,416 --> 00:05:00,875
He Yao! He Yao, come out!

44
00:05:01,583 --> 00:05:02,583
He Yao!

45
00:05:02,791 --> 00:05:03,791
He Yao, come out!

46
00:05:04,458 --> 00:05:05,458
He Yao!

47
00:05:06,375 --> 00:05:07,666
He Yao, get out here!

48
00:05:53,083 --> 00:05:54,083
Lin Zai.

49
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:57,958
A-Leh.

50
00:06:00,500 --> 00:06:02,208
I just had a nightmare.

51
00:06:04,083 --> 00:06:05,291
I dreamed

52
00:06:06,083 --> 00:06:07,791
my brother received my bone marrow,

53
00:06:08,791 --> 00:06:09,875
and then...

54
00:06:14,583 --> 00:06:15,583
Where's my brother?

55
00:06:15,625 --> 00:06:16,625
Where is he?

56
00:06:17,166 --> 00:06:18,166
That dream wasn't real,

57
00:06:18,375 --> 00:06:18,958
right?

58
00:06:19,250 --> 00:06:20,250
I have to go see him.

59
00:06:20,416 --> 00:06:21,458
Lin Zai, listen to me.

60
00:06:28,916 --> 00:06:29,916
Your brother...

61
00:06:30,666 --> 00:06:32,083
I've already buried him.

62
00:06:36,125 --> 00:06:37,541
Buried him?

63
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,000
Where?

64
00:06:47,125 --> 00:06:48,375
I'll take you there.

65
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,000
Brother.

66
00:07:08,250 --> 00:07:09,583
What's going on out there?

67
00:07:12,208 --> 00:07:13,208
Nothing.

68
00:07:14,208 --> 00:07:15,916
Just an accident with the experiment.

69
00:07:16,750 --> 00:07:18,630
I know you're worried
about the immune subject.

70
00:07:19,666 --> 00:07:20,666
Not him.

71
00:07:22,583 --> 00:07:24,000
You misunderstand me.

72
00:07:24,958 --> 00:07:26,166
I'm worried about you.

73
00:07:34,958 --> 00:07:36,041
Lately,

74
00:07:36,708 --> 00:07:38,750
my lucid moments are
getting fewer and fewer.

75
00:07:39,875 --> 00:07:41,708
With what little time I have left,

76
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:44,190
I want to have a real talk with you.

77
00:08:01,208 --> 00:08:02,208
Alright.

78
00:08:13,416 --> 00:08:14,416
Brother,

79
00:08:14,958 --> 00:08:16,750
could you pour me another glass of water?

80
00:08:20,083 --> 00:08:22,166
Here, drink up.

81
00:09:45,708 --> 00:09:46,708
Brother,

82
00:09:48,875 --> 00:09:50,083
these past few days,

83
00:09:51,458 --> 00:09:54,208
I keep thinking back to our school days.

84
00:09:57,208 --> 00:09:58,875
We used to argue over a single question

85
00:09:59,416 --> 00:10:01,083
all night long.

86
00:10:02,416 --> 00:10:03,416
The next day,

87
00:10:03,958 --> 00:10:05,375
you'd still buy breakfast

88
00:10:06,166 --> 00:10:07,583
and leave it on my desk.

89
00:10:10,083 --> 00:10:11,791
Back then, I always felt

90
00:10:12,541 --> 00:10:13,875
that only by beating you

91
00:10:14,750 --> 00:10:16,166
would my life be worthwhile.

92
00:10:19,666 --> 00:10:20,875
Looking back now,

93
00:10:22,666 --> 00:10:23,666
it was so silly.

94
00:10:26,291 --> 00:10:28,208
We wasted so much time

95
00:10:28,583 --> 00:10:29,666
competing with each other.

96
00:10:31,875 --> 00:10:33,541
Only when the world collapsed like this

97
00:10:36,208 --> 00:10:38,083
did we finally face each other.

98
00:10:39,750 --> 00:10:41,150
I don't want to accept this either.

99
00:10:42,916 --> 00:10:43,916
I really don't.

100
00:10:45,958 --> 00:10:47,708
I don't want it to end like this.

101
00:10:55,583 --> 00:10:56,583
Changhuan.

102
00:11:01,583 --> 00:11:02,583
I know.

103
00:11:04,791 --> 00:11:06,125
I can't stop you anymore.

104
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:10,291
But how could I bear

105
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:13,583
to let you walk this path alone?

106
00:11:16,500 --> 00:11:17,500
If it's wrong,

107
00:11:19,250 --> 00:11:20,708
I'll be wrong with you.

108
00:11:25,666 --> 00:11:26,916
You don't blame me?

109
00:11:28,958 --> 00:11:30,083
You don't resent me?

110
00:11:38,375 --> 00:11:43,583
Others might have a hundred thousand
reasons to hate you and resent you.

111
00:11:45,750 --> 00:11:47,166
Just not me.

112
00:11:48,458 --> 00:11:50,916
I will never be your enemy.

113
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:53,583
I am your...

114
00:11:55,125 --> 00:11:56,416
partner in crime.

115
00:13:24,791 --> 00:13:25,791
Brother...

116
00:13:26,708 --> 00:13:27,750
I'm sorry.

117
00:14:34,349 --> 00:14:37,976
[Lin Xian's grave]

118
00:14:45,250 --> 00:14:47,541
Lin Zai, let's head back first.

119
00:14:53,791 --> 00:14:56,125
We can't bring back the dead.

120
00:15:01,458 --> 00:15:01,916
I...

121
00:15:01,917 --> 00:15:04,583
I watched helplessly as my brother

122
00:15:07,083 --> 00:15:08,883
went down fighting the
zombies to protect me.

123
00:15:11,916 --> 00:15:14,083
Back then, I couldn't do anything.

124
00:15:17,916 --> 00:15:20,076
And now, I watched him
die right in front of me again.

125
00:15:23,333 --> 00:15:24,083
I...

126
00:15:24,084 --> 00:15:26,541
What is my immunity even worth?

127
00:15:30,416 --> 00:15:32,000
I can't even save

128
00:15:32,291 --> 00:15:33,651
the person who matters most to me.

129
00:15:40,500 --> 00:15:41,500
A-Leh,

130
00:15:42,333 --> 00:15:43,333
just go.

131
00:15:44,583 --> 00:15:45,750
Leave me alone.

132
00:15:47,416 --> 00:15:49,125
He Yao's experiment proved it.

133
00:15:50,291 --> 00:15:52,125
Being immune doesn't mean a damn thing.

134
00:15:54,250 --> 00:15:56,083
Why are you still staying by my side?

135
00:15:57,791 --> 00:15:58,791
That's not true.

136
00:16:01,750 --> 00:16:02,583
It has to be He Yao's doing...

137
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:03,750
Enough!

138
00:16:06,208 --> 00:16:08,000
I don't want to hear it right now.

139
00:16:12,791 --> 00:16:13,791
Just leave.

140
00:16:15,208 --> 00:16:16,458
I'm begging you.

141
00:17:01,083 --> 00:17:02,333
What reason do I even have

142
00:17:04,166 --> 00:17:05,250
to go on living?

143
00:17:34,416 --> 00:17:35,416
Lin Zai.

144
00:17:35,583 --> 00:17:36,583
You're awake.

145
00:19:03,791 --> 00:19:04,911
What are you thinking about?

146
00:19:07,208 --> 00:19:08,208
Brother.

147
00:19:09,958 --> 00:19:13,750
What do you think
we'll be in the next life?

148
00:19:22,333 --> 00:19:23,333
In the next life?

149
00:19:24,916 --> 00:19:26,791
I hope we meet as strangers.

150
00:19:29,916 --> 00:19:33,958
And that you'll be at the very top,

151
00:19:36,333 --> 00:19:37,791
always leading the way,

152
00:19:38,500 --> 00:19:39,791
shining bright.

153
00:19:46,583 --> 00:19:48,250
Are you worried I won't recognize you?

154
00:19:50,583 --> 00:19:52,500
I'll do everything to make sure you see me.

155
00:19:58,666 --> 00:20:00,106
I would never fail to recognize you.

156
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,458
In this world,

157
00:20:03,333 --> 00:20:05,291
no one knows you better than I do.

158
00:20:07,250 --> 00:20:08,958
When you find an article you love,

159
00:20:09,291 --> 00:20:11,131
you dog-ear the page
to read it over and over.

160
00:20:12,166 --> 00:20:13,750
When you're in a good mood,

161
00:20:14,666 --> 00:20:16,208
you use a ruler to fold origami frogs.

162
00:20:17,416 --> 00:20:18,958
When you're feeling down,

163
00:20:19,333 --> 00:20:21,208
you water the cactus.

164
00:20:22,916 --> 00:20:23,916
You love durian

165
00:20:25,083 --> 00:20:26,166
and hate spinach.

166
00:20:29,708 --> 00:20:33,125
I remember every single part of you.

167
00:20:36,250 --> 00:20:37,250
Changhuan.

168
00:20:38,875 --> 00:20:40,416
This life is still long.

169
00:20:41,291 --> 00:20:45,083
Things will get better for us.

170
00:21:03,083 --> 00:21:04,083
What is it?

171
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:11,375
Don't worry. I'll go check.

172
00:21:45,958 --> 00:21:47,666
Because I saw it with my own eyes.

173
00:21:48,541 --> 00:21:51,875
My brother slowly calmed
down from his frenzy.

174
00:21:53,666 --> 00:21:54,708
Damn it.

175
00:22:03,416 --> 00:22:05,375
You actually used Lin
Zai's brother as bait,

176
00:22:05,750 --> 00:22:07,750
tricking him into your sick experiments!

177
00:22:08,583 --> 00:22:10,291
This is just a sedative!

178
00:22:15,750 --> 00:22:16,750
Yes.

179
00:22:17,125 --> 00:22:18,333
I did lie to him.

180
00:22:18,666 --> 00:22:20,458
But Lin Xian was already beyond saving.

181
00:22:20,708 --> 00:22:22,166
If it wasn't for me,

182
00:22:22,416 --> 00:22:24,559
Lin Zai wouldn't even have
had that last shred of hope.

183
00:22:24,583 --> 00:22:26,166
I gave him something to hold onto,

184
00:22:26,333 --> 00:22:27,790
even if that hope was false.

185
00:22:27,791 --> 00:22:29,333
You call that hope?!

186
00:22:30,125 --> 00:22:31,583
If you hadn't pulled this stunt,

187
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:32,916
he would have been just fine!

188
00:22:36,875 --> 00:22:37,875
A-Leh,

189
00:22:38,541 --> 00:22:40,291
do you really understand Lin Zai?

190
00:22:41,166 --> 00:22:43,375
Just because someone smiles in a crowd,

191
00:22:43,958 --> 00:22:45,750
does that mean he's actually happy?

192
00:22:47,458 --> 00:22:49,583
What the hell are you talking about?!

193
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:51,916
Can't you see it?

194
00:22:52,583 --> 00:22:54,750
After losing his family one by one,

195
00:22:55,750 --> 00:22:57,510
Lin Zai has been living
like an empty shell.

196
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:01,375
At least my experiment made
him feel like he was useful.

197
00:23:06,583 --> 00:23:07,958
But Lin Zai thinks

198
00:23:08,666 --> 00:23:10,458
he's the one who killed his brother!

199
00:23:10,541 --> 00:23:11,541
Fine.

200
00:23:11,583 --> 00:23:13,166
Then go tell him the truth right now.

201
00:23:13,458 --> 00:23:14,458
Go tell him, "Lin Zai,

202
00:23:14,541 --> 00:23:15,541
wake up.

203
00:23:15,583 --> 00:23:17,143
Your brother was already beyond saving.

204
00:23:17,333 --> 00:23:18,957
Everything you did was for nothing.

205
00:23:18,958 --> 00:23:20,333
He Yao played you for a fool."

206
00:23:30,541 --> 00:23:31,541
A-Leh,

207
00:23:32,500 --> 00:23:33,583
let me ask you this.

208
00:23:34,666 --> 00:23:36,333
Do you want to save him,

209
00:23:37,375 --> 00:23:40,916
or do you want to snuff
out his last breath yourself?

210
00:23:54,458 --> 00:23:55,458
At least,

211
00:23:56,291 --> 00:23:58,291
until I find the real answer,

212
00:23:58,583 --> 00:23:59,958
that lie of mine

213
00:24:00,458 --> 00:24:02,208
gives him a reason to hold on.

214
00:24:02,791 --> 00:24:04,208
If you expose it now,

215
00:24:04,416 --> 00:24:06,375
you rip away his last reason to stand.

216
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:13,250
Shut up!

217
00:24:13,791 --> 00:24:15,666
Stop spewing this crap!

218
00:24:20,791 --> 00:24:23,000
Just wait until Lin Zai
decides what to do with you.

219
00:24:35,583 --> 00:24:36,958
Can't you see it?

220
00:24:38,416 --> 00:24:40,208
After losing his family one by one,

221
00:24:40,791 --> 00:24:42,551
Lin Zai has been living
like an empty shell.

222
00:24:45,250 --> 00:24:46,250
At least,

223
00:24:46,875 --> 00:24:48,750
until I find the real answer,

224
00:24:49,416 --> 00:24:50,583
that lie of mine

225
00:24:51,291 --> 00:24:53,083
gives him a reason to hold on.
